<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 34 0 R
/E (The above experiments showed that the 8-neighbor mask can simultaneously detect edges in the vertical, horizontal, and diagonal directions, resulting in richer details in the sharpened image. However, 8-neighbor also amplify noise in the image; 4-neighbor produces cleaner edges but may lose diagonal details. Therefore, I ultimately decided to use 8-neighbor to achieve the best visual effect.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [39]
>>
endobj
